	(gr_text_box "JLCPCB Order Specifications 2026-02-06\n======================================\n\nTop Specifications\n------------------\n\nBase Material: FR4\nLayers: 4\nDimensions: 58.4 * 28.8 mm\nPCB Qty: 5\nProduct Type: Industrial/Consumer electronics\n\nPCB Specifications\n------------------\n\nDeburring/Edge rounding: Yes\nDifferent Design: 1\nDelivery Format: 1\nPCB Thickness: 1.6mm\nPCB Color: Green\nSilkscreen: White\nMaterial Type: S1000H TG155\nSurface Finish: ENIG\n\nHigh-spec Options\n------------------\n\nOuter Copper Weight: 1oz\nInner Copper Weight: 1oz\nSpecify Stackup: Yes\nLayer Stackup: JLC041611-7628\nImpedance Control: No requirement\nVia Covering: Plugged\nVia Plating Method: Not Specified\nMin via hole size/diameter: 0.3mm/(0.4/0.45mm)\nBoard Outline Tolerance: 0.2mm(Regular)\nConfirm Production file: Yes\nMark on PCB: Order Number(Specify Position)\nElectrical Test: Flying Probe Fully Test\nGold Fingers: No\nCastellated Holes: No\nPress-Fit Hole: No\nEdge Plating: No\nBlind Slots: No\nUL Marking: No\nBackdrill: No\n\nPCB Remark\n----------\nPTH holes marked with {dblquote}o{dblquote} in the drill map are vias with exposed copper on the top layer, and must only be tented on the bottom side of the PCB.\n\nPCB Assembly\n======================================\n\nPCBA Type: Economic\nAssembly Side: Top Side\nPCBA Qty: 5\nTooling Holes: Added by Customer\nConfirm Parts Placement: Yes\nStencil Storage: No\nFixture Storage: No\nParts Selection: By Customer\n\nAdvanced Options\n----------------\n\n*Use default options*\n\nPCBA Remark: None"
		(start 19.125 15)
		(end 94.875 195.5)
